   "title": "Prompt",
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Create an original ultra-detailed photorealistic natural sandstone surface texture. Fine mineral grains, delicate sedimentary formations, tiny pores, subtle geological imperfections, natural erosion marks. Realistic warm-beige, muted taupe, pale sandstone, and soft earthy color variations. Physically plausible mineral surface characteristics, extraordinary microtexture detail, consistent material scale. Uniform neutral diffuse illumination across the entire surface. Orthographic top-down material capture, flat surface, no perspective distortion. The texture must cover the entire image continuously without borders. No directional sunlight, no strong shadows, no decorative objects, no architectural elements. Natural realistic sandstone material suitable for architectural visualization and game development. Design for seamless tiling across opposite image boundaries. Original material pattern, no typography, no logos, no watermarks. Square format."
   ]
